<metadata><name>Galičica trail MTB-8</name><desc>MTB-8 is one of Galičica National Park's mountain bike trails, some of them handy links between hiking routes. It's 1.5 km from above Trpejca (996 m) to above Trpejca (889 m), with about 24 m of climbing and 129 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 865 m and 997 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/mtb-8/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
